      "problem": "Let\n$a=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}p \\\\ -3 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].$\nIf $a\\cdot b=8$, find the value of $p.$",
